WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Welcome! Learn Dutch step by step. First choose your app language at the top.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Select Practice. Choose an exercise. Read the question and try answering yourself.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Select Need help? Explain what is difficult. Your coach will give you a hint.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Open AI Coach. You can type or speak. Making mistakes is part of learning.

5
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Open Reading and news. Search for a topic. Choose Practise this news with AI.

6
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:37.000
My progress shows what you have completed. Start with one small exercise.

